### ============================================================
### SUMOylation Pathway Activity and Drug Resistance in AML
### Full analysis pipeline: data preparation -> pathway scoring ->
### drug correlation -> subtype stratification -> genome-wide DEA/enrichment
### -> visualization
###
### Downstream analysis (stratification, DEA, PCA/UMAP) uses the E1 complex
### score (SAE1 + UBA2 combined) rather than UBA2 alone: gene-level results
### show SAE1 tracks with UBA2 (same direction, overlapping top drug hits),
### and combining them gives more significant associations while preserving
### the resistance-direction pattern (see section 2.4).
### ============================================================

